<title>SOUTH AFRICA: New Central Wits ups year div, shr drops.</title>
<headline>New Central Wits ups year div, shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     242.0	 vs 424.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 241.0	 vs 207.0</p>
<p>    Net earnings	    4.28	  vs 7.49</p>
<p>    Investment income     4.61	  vs 3.93</p>
<p>    Admin expenses	  0.48	  vs 0.49</p>
<p>Full name: New Central Witwatersrand Areas Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm gave no dividend date details in its announcement. It added that the total net earnings figure for the comparative period included surpluses on realisation of investments in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
